<title>JAPAN: Shizuoka Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shizuoka Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	   144.31		vs	  169.29</p>
<p> Operating	   21.00		vs	   25.12</p>
<p> Current	     17.77		vs	   19.85</p>
<p> Net		   12.75		vs	   10.96</p>
<p> EPS		   15.85 yen	  vs	   13.62 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    805 million	  vs	 805 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shizuoka Bank Ltd is a regional bank with branches in Hong Kong and Los Angeles.</p>
